WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
- I'm sure you all saw Adam perform

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.330
at the Emmy Awards last month.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.760
It was incredible.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.180
But here's the funny part of it

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.600
is you were under attack for like,

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.090
first of all, the greatest thing ever.

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.570
- I was under attack, guys.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.690
I was attacked!

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.930
Well, they, Variety
said that I lip synced.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:21.090
- Which, by the way, just
means you're that bad ass.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.040
- Well, thank you for that.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.770
But I sang, I sang that.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:26.560
And I was pretty bummed.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.160
- No, I know, that's
happened to me before,

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.748
and I was like, I wanted to
call this lady named Lisa.

00:00:30.748 --> 00:00:33.910
- I feel like any real
singer would have been like,

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.200
oh no, he sang that, you could tell.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.100
- Yeah, no, no, but
that's what I'm saying,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.014
it was actually a good thing.

00:00:39.014 --> 00:00:41.390
Like I got so mad about
it when it happened to me

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.380
like years ago.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.931
'Cause I was like, I just
worked my tail off on stage.

00:00:44.931 --> 00:00:45.764
- [Adam] Yeah.

00:00:45.764 --> 00:00:46.597
- And somebody said that.

00:00:46.597 --> 00:00:47.430
And then everybody was like,

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:48.970
well maybe it just
means you did it so well

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:49.803
that people thought it had to have been.

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:52.330
- By the way, if I'm
ever asked to do anything

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.110
like that again, I'm more
than happy to lip sync.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.460
That would take away
like all the pressure.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.430
- Oh my gosh, right, and running around.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:02.480
- Because it's like a
full day of rehearsal.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.313
Like the day before,

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:05.150
and I'm just like trying
to learn like dance moves.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.900
And I'm not a real dancer or singer,

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.972
so I'm like not in my--

00:01:07.972 --> 00:01:09.097
- But that's what makes it awesome.

00:01:09.097 --> 00:01:09.930
- It's what makes it fun.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:10.763
- Yeah, you sell it.

00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:11.830
That's the best part.
- Yeah.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:14.780
Where I feel like me out there doing that

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.780
it gives like anyone hope.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:18.220
(laughing)

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.053
- That's how I feel.

00:01:19.053 --> 00:01:20.810
- It's just a guy out there who's mute,

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:22.250
he's like maybe I could.

